    "article_summary": "This article describes a dual photoredox/manganese catalytic system for the atom transfer radical addition (ATRA) of bromonitromethane and 1,2-dibromotetrafluoroethane to unactivated alkenes. The system utilizes 4CzIPN as an organic photocatalyst and MnBr2 as a co-catalyst to facilitate carbon-bromine bond formation, overcoming limitations of previous copper-based systems with these specific halides.",
